 ## Background
-The method was proposed by H. Hong, J. H. Bay, K. Eui, and Y. Shin from the School of Computer Science and Engineering, Seoul National University, Korea [S1]. It was published in 2005 in the proceedings of the International Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention (MICCAI) [S1]. The work addresses the need for radiologists and surgeons to simultaneously view complementary information from different modalities (PET, CT, MRI) for diagnosis and treatment planning [S1].
